          "filename": "Rocky beach at Nanven - geograph.org.uk - 229794.jpg",
          "caption": "Rocky beach at Nanven. Looking out to sea at low tide from the rocky beach at Nanven, with boulders that have been weathered into smooth shapes by the action of the sea. On the horizon: The Brisons.",
